event: delegated_tool_call
data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"tool_input":{"content":"# Daily Self-Evolution Monitor — Day 01\n## Task Family: `archive_readiness_probe`\n**Date:** 2026-05-25 (probe executed 2026-05-26T00:18 UTC)\n**Governing Artifact:** `self_evolution_skill_optimization_merge_archive_rules.md` (§4 — Domain C)\n**Predecessor Evidence Chain:** precipitation_seed (Day 01), duplicate_merge_probe (Day 01), runs 33–51\n**Source Refs:** R1–R9 (per precipitation seed), C4–C8, C14–C15, C23–C24 counters\n\n---\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n1. [Scope & Method](#1-scope--method)\n2. [Landscape Census — All 27 Skills](#2-landscape-census--all-27-skills)\n3. [Real Stale-Threshold Evidence](#3-real-stale-threshold-evidence)\n4. [Forced Diagnostic Stale-Threshold Evidence](#4-forced-diagnostic-stale-threshold-evidence)\n5. [Protection Blockers — Hard Block Conditions](#5-protection-blockers--hard-block-conditions)\n6. [Rollback Requirements Inventory](#6-rollback-requirements-inventory)\n7. [Readiness Verdict: Production vs Diagnostic-Only](#7-readiness-verdict-production-vs-diagnostic-only)\n8. [Prerequisite Infrastructure Gap Analysis](#8-prerequisite-infrastructure-gap-analysis)\n9. [Artifact Metadata](#9-artifact-metadata)\n\n---\n\n## 1. Scope & Method\n\nThis probe evaluates archive readiness per **Domain C — Inactive Skill Archival** (§4 of the governing rules artifact). It examines all 27 skill directories currently present in `available_skills/`, cross-referencing:\n\n- **Trigger conditions** C1–C5 (§4.1)\n- **Hard block conditions** (§4.2 — reverse dependency, sole capability class, allowlist reference)\n- **Prerequisite infrastructure** (usage telemetry, registry, `_meta.json` status field)\n\n**Critical distinction applied throughout:** This probe separates **real stale-threshold evidence** (objective timestamps proving inactivity) from **forced diagnostic stale-threshold evidence** (apparent staleness caused by absent measurement infrastructure, not true inactivity).\n\n### 1.1 — Canonical Data Sources Used\n\n| Ref | Source | Type | Content Used |\n|-----|--------|------|-------------|\n| R4 | `available_skills/*/` | Directory enumeration | 27 skill dirs, file listings, modification timestamps |\n| R5 | `skills/*/` | Source-root mirror | 5 packages, cross-reference |\n| R8 | `~/.macaca/skills/*/_meta.json` | Global metadata | 4 global entries |\n| R2 | `agent-replay-*.jsonl` | Execution telemetry | 3 files, 10 events, zero `skill_invoke` |\n| R1 | `mission-state.json` | Mission lifecycle | 3 missions, 5 agents, last activity 2026-04-13 |\n| — | `_meta.json` per skill | Governance metadata | 4 files found (of 27) |\n| — | Filesystem `stat` timestamps | Last-modified evidence | All 27 dirs scanned |\n\n### 1.2 — Threshold Defaults (from §6 Glossary)\n\n| Symbol | Domain | Default | Applied In |\n|--------|--------|---------|------------|\n| `T_inactive_days` | C | 90 days | C1 trigger |\n| `T_grace_cycles` | C | 10 cycles | C2 trigger |\n| `T_error_only_min` | C | 3 errors, 0 successes | C3 trigger |\n| `T_archive_retention_days` | C | 365 days | Cleanup policy D1 |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Landscape Census — All 27 Skills\n\n### 2.1 — Convention Compliance Matrix\n\n| # | Directory | SKILL.md | `_meta.json` | `_usage.json` | Status Field | Filesystem Age | PublishedAt Age |\n|---|-----------|----------|-------------|-------------|-------------|----------------|-----------------|\n| 1 | weather | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | **MISSING** | 16,947 days* | **141.0 days** |\n| 2 | stock_analysis | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | **MISSING** | 23.0 days | **112.1 days** |\n| 3 | playwright_mcp | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | **MISSING** | 29.0 days | **106.0 days** |\n| 4 | crypto_market | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | **MISSING** | 10.4 days | 68.6 days |\n| 5 | gitnexus_cli | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | **67.1 days** | — |\n| 6 | gitnexus_debugging | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | **67.1 days** | — |\n| 7 | gitnexus_exploring | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | **67.1 days** | — |\n| 8 | gitnexus_guide | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | **67.1 days** | — |\n| 9 | gitnexus_impact_analysis | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | **67.1 days** | — |\n| 10 | gitnexus_pr_review | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | **67.1 days** | — |\n| 11 | gitnexus_refactoring | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | **67.1 days** | — |\n| 12 | chronicle | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 12.4 days | — |\n| 13 | figma | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 12.5 days | — |\n| 14 | figma_mcp | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 12.0 days | — |\n| 15 | golang | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 12.0 days | — |\n| 16 | openspec | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 12.0 days | — |\n| 17 | shadcn_ui | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 12.0 days | — |\n| 18 | telemetry_optimization | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 0.0 days | — |\n| 19 | materialization_activation_telemetry_registry | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 0.0 days | — |\n| 20 | materialization_proposal_linked_skill_package_registry_load_path | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 0.0 days | — |\n| 21 | materialization_skill_package_registry_load_path_usage_telemetry | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 0.0 days | — |\n| 22 | skill-exp-052e6a93-9680-4a98-bc7a-441abfc18c46-... | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 1.2 days | — |\n| 23 | skill-exp-2b07b1df-173c-47ad-aa62-8a076cd6c26c-... | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 1.2 days | — |\n| 24 | skill-exp-4d613241-8b59-45ad-8daa-d5cb5dc1fb3e-... | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 1.2 days | — |\n| 25 | skill_exp_0bd3b7f3_6797_40d8_ba1a_d53409bb4536_... | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 1.2 days | — |\n| 26 | skill_exp_1590b4d7_0aa7_4d87_ad40_14e222b2394b_... | ✅ | ❌ | ❌ | **NO META** | 1.2 days | — |\n| 27 | crypto_market | ✅ | ✅ | ❌ | **MISSING** | 10.4 days | 68.6 days |\n\n> * `weather` filesystem timestamps show `1980-01-01` (epoch 0 artifact) — not a reliable modification signal. PublishedAt timestamp is authoritative for weather.\n\n### 2.2 — Aggregate Counters\n\n| Metric | Value | Reference |\n|--------|-------|-----------|\n| Total skill directories | 27 | C4 (Day 01) |\n| Convention-compliant (SKILL.md + `_meta.json`) | 4 | C5 (Day 01) |\n| With `_usage.json` (telemetry) | **0** | C15 (Day 01) |\n| With `.registry.json` | **0** | C14 (Day 01) |\n| With `status` field populated | **0** | All MISSING |\n| Source-root mirror packages (`skills/`) | 5 | C23 (Day 01) |\n| Mutation mementos | 18 | C24 (Day 01) |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Real Stale-Threshold Evidence\n\n**Definition:** Objective, measurable timestamps proving a skill has not been invoked or modified for a period exceeding `T_inactive_days` (90 days default). These are independent of telemetry infrastructure.\n\n### 3.1 — Skills Exceeding `T_inactive_days` (90 days)\n\n| # | Skill | Trigger | Evidence | Age (days) | Threshold Exceeded |\n|---|-------|---------|----------|-----------|-------------------|\n| **C1-Candidate 1** | **weather** | C1 (no invocations) | PublishedAt `2026-01-05` (141 days ago); zero `_usage.json`; zero replay events referencing `weather` | **141.0** | **⚠️ YES** |\n| **C1-Candidate 2** | **stock_analysis** | C1 (no invocations) | PublishedAt `2026-02-02` (112 days ago); zero `_usage.json`; zero replay events | **112.1** | **⚠️ YES** |\n| **C1-Candidate 3** | **playwright_mcp** | C1 (no invocations) | PublishedAt `2026-02-08` (106 days ago); zero `_usage.json`; zero replay events | **106.0** | **⚠️ YES** |\n\n**Supporting telemetry evidence for all three:**\n- No `skill_invoke` events exist in any of the 3 agent-replay files (10 events total, all `agent_start`/`agent_stop`)\n- Last agent activity across all missions: `2026-04-13T06:50:55.658Z` (42 days of absolute agent inactivity)\n- No `_usage.json` exists for any skill — telemetry infrastructure is entirely absent\n- No `.registry.json` exists — no registration, no allowlist, no reverse-dependency graph\n\n### 3.2 — Skills Approaching Threshold (30–89 days)\n\nThese do not yet exceed `T_inactive_days=90` but show extended dormancy:\n\n| # | Skill | Age (days) | Notes |\n|---|-------|-----------|-------|\n| C1-Approaching 1 | gitnexus_cli | 67.1 | Files modified 2026-03-19; no `_meta.json`; no telemetry |\n| C1-Approaching 2 | gitnexus_debugging | 67.1 | Same batch as above |\n| C1-Approaching 3 | gitnexus_exploring | 67.1 | Same batch as above |\n| C1-Approaching 4 | gitnexus_guide | 67.1 | Same batch as above |\n| C1-Approaching 5 | gitnexus_impact_analysis | 67.1 | Same batch as above |\n| C1-Approaching 6 | gitnexus_pr_review | 67.1 | Same batch as above |\n| C1-Approaching 7 | gitnexus_refactoring | 67.1 | Same batch as above |\n| C1-Approaching 8 | crypto_market | 68.6 | PublishedAt 2026-03-18; has `_meta.json`; no telemetry |\n\n### 3.3 — Trigger Conditions Met (Per §4.1)\n\n| Trigger | Skills Triggered | Evidence |\n|---------|-----------------|----------|\n| **C1** — No invocations within 90-day lookback | weather, stock_analysis, playwright_mcp | PublishedAt + 0 `_usage.json` + 0 replay skill_invoke events = presumptive zero invocation |\n| **C2** — Zero invocation count after grace cycles | **All 27** | All `invocationCount` values are effectively 0 (no `_usage.json` exists for any) |\n| **C3** — Error-only usage history | **Cannot assess** | Zero telemetry means zero error data |\n| **C4** — Deprecated without replacement | **Cannot assess** | No skill has `status: deprecated` set |\n| **C5** — Manual archive flag | **None flagged** | No `_meta.json.archiveCandidate = true` found |\n\n**C2 observation:** All 27 skills have existed for >10 cycles (the `T_grace_cycles` default) since the earliest publishedAt or filesystem timestamp. Combined with zero telemetry, every skill technically meets C2. However, this is a **diagnostic artifact** — see §4.\n\n### 3.4 — PublishedAt Chronology\n\n```\n2026-01-05  weather            ⚠️ 141 days (C1 triggered)\n2026-02-02  stock_analysis     ⚠️ 112 days (C1 triggered)\n2026-02-08  playwright_mcp     ⚠️ 106 days (C1 triggered)\n2026-03-18  crypto_market      68.6 days (approaching)\n2026-03-19  gitnexus_* (x7)    67.1 days (filesystem; no meta)\n2026-04-26  playwright_mcp      29.0 days (filesystem; dir updated)\n2026-05-03  stock_analysis      23.0 days (filesystem; dir updated)\n2026-05-13  chronicle/figma/    12.5 days (recent metadata pass)\n            golang/openspec/\n            shadcn_ui\n2026-05-24  skill-exp-* (x5)    1.2 days (experimental)\n2026-05-25  materialization-*   0.0 days (current cycle)\n            telemetry_optimization\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. Forced Diagnostic Stale-Threshold Evidence\n\n**Definition:** Conditions that superficially appear to indicate staleness but are in reality consequences of absent measurement instrumentation. These are false positives for archive candidacy.\n\n### 4.1 — Infrastructure Gaps Producing False Positives\n\n| Gap | Impact | Skills Affected | False-Positive Signal |\n|-----|--------|----------------|----------------------|\n| **G1** — Zero `_usage.json` files | No invocation count, no last-invoked timestamp, no success/error ratio | **All 27 (100%)** | Every skill appears to have `invocationCount=0` |\n| **G2** — Zero `.registry.json` files | No allowlist, no registration, no reverse-dependency graph | **All 27 (100%)** | Cannot disprove \"no reverse dependency\" |\n| **G3** — Zero `status` field in any `_meta.json` | Cannot distinguish `draft` vs `active` vs `deprecated` | **All 4 with meta + 21 without (= all 27)** | All skills appear stateless |\n| **G4** — Zero `stateTransitions` arrays | No lifecycle provenance exists | **All 27** | Cannot verify any skill was ever promoted to `active` |\n| **G5** — 21/27 skills lack `_meta.json` entirely | No ownerId, no version, no publishedAt | **21 (78%)** | Cannot verify ownership or governance scope |\n| **G6** — No `skill_invoke` events in replay logs | Skill invocation never recorded | **All 27** | Every skill appears never-invoked |\n| **G7** — Last agent replay `2026-04-13` (42 days ago) | No recent execution cycles to generate telemetry | **All agents** | System-wide inactivity, not skill-specific |\n\n### 4.2 — Forced C2 Trigger (False Positive)\n\nPer §4.1 C2: *\"Zero invocation count after grace cycles\"* — Because no `_usage.json` exists for any of the 27 skills, the `invocationCount` is implicitly 0 for every skill. All skills have existed beyond 10 execution cycles (by publishedAt or filesystem evidence). **This means all 27 technically meet the C2 trigger condition.** This is a **forced diagnostic false positive** — the condition fires not because the skills are truly inactive, but because the measurement instrument (`_usage.json`) has never been deployed.\n\n**Diagnosis:** C2 is unactionable until `_usage.json` infrastructure is established and at least one cycle of telemetry collection completes.\n\n### 4.3 — Forced C3 Trigger (Not Assessable)\n\nPer §4.1 C3: *\"Error-only usage history\"* — Zero telemetry means zero error data. C3 can neither be triggered nor ruled out until `_usage.json` files exist with `successCount` and `errorCount` fields.\n\n### 4.4 — Forced C4 Trigger (Not Assessable)\n\nPer §4.1 C4: *\"Deprecated without replacement consumed\"* — No skill has `status: deprecated`. The entire deprecation chain is absent. C4 cannot fire.\n\n### 4.5 — Consequences of Diagnostic-Only Status\n\n| If archive were attempted today... | Result |\n|-----------------------------------|--------|\n| `_meta.json` status update to `archived` | ❌ Impossible for 21/27 (no meta); status field missing for all 4 with meta |\n| `archivedAt` timestamp recording | ❌ Impossible without meta |\n| Registry removal | ❌ No registry exists to remove from |\n| Archive index append | ❌ No `skill-archive-index.json` exists |\n| Reverse-dependency check | ❌ Cannot perform; no `dependencies` fields exist |\n| Sole-capability-class check | ❌ Cannot perform; no keyword/tool telemetry |\n| Allowlist reference check | ❌ Cannot perform; no registry/allowlist |\n\n---\n\n## 5. Protection Blockers — Hard Block Conditions\n\nPer §4.2, archive SHALL NOT proceed if any hard block condition is true. The following table evaluates each condition across all candidate skills.\n\n### 5.1 — Hard Block Evaluation\n\n| Block Condition | Check Method | Result | Verdict |\n|----------------|-------------|--------|---------|\n| **B1 — Active reverse dependency** | Scan all `_meta.json` `dependencies[]` for candidate slug | ❌ Cannot evaluate — zero `dependencies` fields exist in any `_meta.json`. 21/27 have no `_meta.json` at all. | **BLOCKED — Insufficient data** |\n| **B2 — Sole capability class rep** | Keyword overlap scan across all SKILL.md files | ⚠️ **Partially evaluable.** Only 4 skills have `_meta.json`. The 7 gitnexus-* skills all share GitNexus domain — likely overlapping capability class, reducing sole-representative risk for any single one. However, weather's weather-reporting capability and stock_analysis's market-analysis capability may be unique. | **BLOCKED — Cannot confirm** |\n| **B3 — Active allowlist reference** | Check `.registry.json` or equivalent allowlist/catalog | ❌ Cannot evaluate — zero `.registry.json` files exist. No allowlist infrastructure. | **BLOCKED — No infrastructure** |\n\n### 5.2 — Protection Blocker Summary\n\n| Blocker | Severity | Affected Candidates | Workaround Needed |\n|---------|----------|-------------------|-------------------|\n| No `_meta.json` for 21/27 skills | **CRITICAL** | All non-convention skills | Create `_meta.json` with at minimum: `slug`, `ownerId`, `version`, `publishedAt`, `status` |\n| No `status` field in any existing `_meta.json` | **CRITICAL** | weather, stock_analysis, playwright_mcp, crypto_market | Add `status: \"active\"` or `\"draft\"` based on provenance evidence |\n| No `_usage.json` for any skill | **HIGH** | All 27 | Deploy telemetry collection; wait ≥1 execution cycle |\n| No `.registry.json` | **HIGH** | All 27 | Create registry with skill entries |\n| No `dependencies[]` in any meta | **MEDIUM** | All 27 | Populate dependency graph |\n| Zero `stateTransitions[]` logs | **MEDIUM** | All 27 | Initialize state transition history |\n| No archive index file | **LOW** | N/A | Create `shared/skill-archive-index.json` |\n\n### 5.3 — Blocking Score by Candidate\n\n| Candidate | Meta Present | Status Present | Telemetry | Registry | Dependency Data | **Archive-Block Score** |\n|-----------|-------------|---------------|-----------|----------|----------------|------------------------|\n| weather | ✅ | ❌ (MISSING) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **5/5 blockers** |\n| stock_analysis | ✅ | ❌ (MISSING) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **5/5 blockers** |\n| playwright_mcp | ✅ | ❌ (MISSING) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **5/5 blockers** |\n| gitnexus_* (x7) | ❌ | ❌ (no meta) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **6/5 blockers** (no meta is extra) |\n| All others | ❌ (mostly) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | **5-6/5 blockers** |\n\n> Score interpretation: 0 = archive-ready, 5+ = fully blocked. All candidates score maximum blockers.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Rollback Requirements Inventory\n\nPer §5.3 of the governing rules, every archive action requires a rollback record with 14 mandatory fields. Below is the rollback readiness assessment.\n\n### 6.1 — Pre-Archive Snapshot Requirements\n\n| Rollback Requirement | Available Today? | Gap |\n|---------------------|-----------------|-----|\n| Pre-archive SKILL.md snapshot | ❌ | No snapshot mechanism deployed; no backup copies exist |\n| Pre-archive `_meta.json` snapshot | ❌ | 21/27 have no meta; 4/4 have no status field |\n| Original action review ID | ❌ | No archive review IDs exist (no archive actions taken yet) |\n| Reviewer attribution | ❌ | No operator/agent identification for lifecycle actions |\n| Pre-rollback state description | ❌ | State unknown for 21/27 skills |\n| Rollback ID namespace | ❌ | No `rollback-*` records exist yet |\n| Data restoration path | ❌ | No backup archive exists |\n\n### 6.2 — Rollback Record Template Readiness\n\nThe governing rules define the rollback schema at `shared/skill-rollback-<SLUG>-<YYYYMMDD>.md`. However:\n\n- **Rollback data preservation rule** (§5.3): *\"Before executing any optimization, merge, or archive, the pre-action state of SKILL.md and `_meta.json` SHALL be preserved as a snapshot within the corresponding audit record.\"*\n- **Current status:** Zero pre-action snapshots exist for any skill. The archive pipeline cannot execute until this preservation infrastructure is in place.\n- **Required:** A snapshot capture mechanism that copies SKILL.md + `_meta.json` to the audit record before any state change.\n\n### 6.3 — Rollback Path Per Candidate (Hypothetical)\n\n| Candidate | If Archived, Rollback Would Require |\n|-----------|--------------------------------------|\n| weather | Create `_meta.json` status field first; set to `active` or `draft` based on provenance; restore SKILL.md from hypothetical snapshot |\n| stock_analysis | Same as weather; additionally, directory has subdirs (docs/, scripts/, .omc/) — rollback must verify all sub-structures |\n| playwright_mcp | Same pattern |\n| gitnexus_* (x7) | Create entire `_meta.json` ex nihilo to enable rollback; current state has zero governance metadata |\n| skill-exp-* (x5) | Experimental — may lack stable slug; UUID-based names complicate rollback tracking |\n\n**Rollback readiness verdict:** 🔴 **NOT READY.** Zero rollback infrastructure exists. No pre-action snapshots, no backup copies, no rollback ID namespace.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Readiness Verdict: Production vs Diagnostic-Only\n\n### 7.1 — Summary Judgment\n\n| Dimension | Status | Detail |\n|-----------|--------|--------|\n| Candidate identification | ✅ **Done** | 3 skills exceed `T_inactive_days` (weather, stock_analysis, playwright_mcp). 7 more approaching (gitnexus batch at 67d). |\n| Real stale evidence | ✅ **Collected** | PublishedAt timestamps, filesystem modification dates, replay log absence all converge |\n| Forced diagnostic evidence | ✅ **Separated** | C2 false-positive (all 27), zero-telemetry artifact, no-registry artifact |\n| Protection blocker evaluation | ⚠️ **Partial** | All conditions evaluable as blocked; B1/B2/B3 cannot be cleared |\n| Rollback infrastructure | ❌ **Absent** | No snapshots, no backup, no rollback IDs |\n| Archive index | ❌ **Not created** | `shared/skill-archive-index.json` does not exist |\n| Registry | ❌ **Absent** | No `.registry.json` for any skill domain |\n| Telemetry (`_usage.json`) | ❌ **Zero deployed** | All 27 skills lack usage tracking |\n| `_meta.json` status field | ❌ **Missing on all 27** | No skill has a populated `status` field |\n\n### 7.2 — Readiness Classification\n\n```\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│              ARCHIVE READINESS VERDICT               │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                                                      │\n│   🔴  DIAGNOSTIC-ONLY  —  NOT PRODUCTION-READY      │\n│                                                      │\n│   Archive execution is blocked on 5 prerequisite     │\n│   infrastructure layers (see §5.2).                  │\n│                                                      │\n│   Until all of the following are deployed:           │\n│   • _usage.json telemetry (at least 1 cycle)         │\n│   • .registry.json with dependency graph             │\n│   • _meta.json status field on all skills            │\n│   • skill-archive-index.json                         │\n│   • Pre-action snapshot mechanism                    │\n│                                                      │\n│   ...no skill can be safely archived.                │\n│                                                      │\n│   However, candidate identification IS valid and     │\n│   ready for preliminary monitoring.                  │\n│                                                      │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 7.3 — Candidate Watchlist (Pre-Production Monitoring)\n\nThese 3 skills are confirmed C1 triggers and should be the **first candidates** when infrastructure is ready:\n\n| Priority | Skill | Slug | Days Since Published | Risk |\n|----------|-------|------|---------------------|------|\n| **P1** | weather | `weather` | 141.0 | Highest; pre-dates all others by >1 month |\n| **P2** | stock_analysis | `stock-analysis` | 112.1 | Second; has complex subdirectory structure (docs, scripts) |\n| **P3** | playwright_mcp | `playwright-mcp` | 106.0 | Third; has `_meta.json` but no status |\n\nAdditionally, the 7 gitnexus-* skills (67 days) should be added to the watchlist when they cross 90 days (projected: ~2026-06-16).\n\n---\n\n## 8. Prerequisite Infrastructure Gap Analysis\n\n### 8.1 — Gap Closure Roadmap\n\n| Layer | Action Required | Effort | Dependencies | Estimated Cycles |\n|-------|----------------|--------|-------------|-----------------|\n| **GAP-1: `_meta.json` creation** | Create `_meta.json` for 21 skills with: `slug`, `ownerId`, `version`, `publishedAt`, `status`, `dependencies[]`, `stateTransitions[]` | **HIGH** (21 files) | Needs slug inventory, owner ID assignment, version baseline from SKILL.md content hash | 2–3 cycles |\n| **GAP-2: Status field population** | Add `status: \"active\" | \"draft\"` to all 27 `_meta.json` files based on provenance evidence | **MEDIUM** (27 fields) | Completed GAP-1 | 1 cycle |\n| **GAP-3: `_usage.json` deployment** | Create `_usage.json` with schema: `invocationCount`, `successCount`, `errorCount`, `lastInvokedAt`, `sessionRefs[]` | **LOW** per skill (27 files) | Needs usage-tracking agent hook | 1 cycle + 1 observation |\n| **GAP-4: `.registry.json` creation** | Create registry with all 27 skills, their slugs, dependencies, allowlist | **MEDIUM** | Completed GAP-1, GAP-2 | 1 cycle |\n| **GAP-5: Archive index creation** | Create `shared/skill-archive-index.json` with `schemaVersion: \"1.0\"`, empty `archived[]` | **LOW** (1 file) | None | 1 cycle |\n| **GAP-6: Snapshot mechanism** | Deploy pre-action snapshot capture that copies SKILL.md + `_meta.json` to audit record before any state change | **MEDIUM** | None | 1 cycle |\n| **GAP-7: Rollback namespace** | Create rollback record template directory; establish `rollback-*` ID convention | **LOW** | None | 1 cycle |\n\n### 8.2 — Dependency Graph for Production Readiness\n\n```\nGAP-1 (_meta.json) ──► GAP-2 (status field) ──► GAP-4 (registry)\n                                         │\n                                         └──► GAP-3 (_usage.json) ──► C1/C2/C3 assessment\n                                                                          │\n                                                                          ▼\n                                                              Archive Candidate Confirmation\n                                                                          │\n                                                     GAP-5 (index) ◄─────┘\n                                                          │\n                                                     GAP-6 (snapshot)\n                                                          │\n                                                     GAP-7 (rollback)\n                                                          │\n                                                          ▼\n                                                  PRODUCTION-READY\n```\n\n**Critical path:** GAP-1 → GAP-2 → GAP-4 + GAP-3 → Archive execution.\n\n### 8.3 — Minimum Viable Path to Production\n\nThe most compressed path to production-ready archive capability:\n\n1. **Cycle N:** Create `_meta.json` for 21 skills (bulk operation) + populate `status` on all 27 + create empty archive index.\n2. **Cycle N+1:** Deploy `_usage.json` creation hook + create `.registry.json` + deploy snapshot mechanism.\n3. **Cycle N+2:** Execute 1 observation cycle (let telemetry accumulate).\n4. **Cycle N+3:** Re-run archive readiness probe. If all blockers cleared → **production ready**.\n\n**Minimum: 3 additional cycles from Day 01.**\n\n---\n\n## 9. Artifact Metadata\n\n| Field | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| Artifact | `shared/self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_archive_readiness_probe.md` |\n| Task Family | `archive_readiness_probe` |\n| Date | 2026-05-25 (probe executed 2026-05-26T00:18 UTC) |\n| Governing Rules | `self_evolution_skill_optimization_merge_archive_rules.md` §4 (Domain C) |\n| Predecessor Probes | `precipitation_seed` (Day 01), `duplicate_merge_probe` (Day 01) |\n| Skills Evaluated | 27 (all in `available_skills/`) |\n| Real Stale Candidates | 3 (weather, stock_analysis, playwright_mcp) |\n| Approaching Threshold | 8 (7 gitnexus-* at 67d, crypto_market at 68d) |\n| Forced Diagnostic Triggers | C2 (all 27 — false positive), C3 (unassessable), C4 (unassessable) |\n| Protection Blockers Found | 5 (see §5.2) |\n| Infrastructure Gaps Identified | 7 (see §8.1) |\n| Rollback Readiness | 🔴 NOT READY — zero snapshot/backup infrastructure |\n| **Readiness Classification** | **🔴 DIAGNOSTIC-ONLY — NOT PRODUCTION-READY** |\n| Minimum Cycles to Production | 3 additional cycles |\n| Reviewer | `coordinator` (automated probe, Day 01 cycle) |\n\n---\n\n*End of archive readiness probe. Candidate identification is valid. Infrastructure prerequisites are absent. All conclusions are diagnostic — archive execution SHALL NOT proceed until infrastructure gaps GAP-1 through GAP-7 are closed and this probe returns a PRODUCTION-READY verdict.*\n","file_path":"shared/self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_archive_readiness_probe.md"},"tool_name":"file_write","type":"tool_call"},"task_id":"3a1eec55-7843-4b82-8d67-812b59cb5f8f"}

