data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","output":"**`shared/self_evolution_2026-05-25_day-01_archive_readiness_probe.md`** created successfully (420 lines, 27.8 KB).\n\n---\n\n## Summary of Findings\n\n### 🔴 Verdict: DIAGNOSTIC-ONLY — Not Production-Ready\n\nArchive execution is fully blocked on 5 prerequisite infrastructure layers. The probe separates real evidence from forced diagnostic evidence:\n\n### Real Stale-Threshold Candidates (C1 triggered — 90+ days)\n| Skill | Age | Published |\n|-------|-----|-----------|\n| **weather** | **141 days** | 2026-01-05 |\n| **stock_analysis** | **112 days** | 2026-02-02 |\n| **playwright_mcp** | **106 days** | 2026-02-08 |\n\n### Approaching Threshold (67–68 days)\n- **gitnexus_cli/debugging/exploring/guide/impact_analysis/pr_review/refactoring** (7 skills, 67 days each)\n- **crypto_market** (68.6 days)\n\n### Forced Diagnostic False Positives Identified\n| Trigger | Signal | Root Cause |\n|---------|--------|-----------|\n| **C2** — Zero invocations after grace | **All 27 skills triggered** | No `_usage.json` exists for ANY skill — every invocation count is implicitly 0 |\n| **C3** — Error-only history | Cannot assess | Zero telemetry = zero error data |\n| **C4** — Deprecated chain | Cannot assess | No skill has `status: deprecated` |\n\n### 5 Protection Blockers (all critical)\n1. **No `_meta.json`** for 21 of 27 skills (78%)\n2. **No `status` field** in any of the 4 existing `_meta.json` files\n3. **No `_usage.json`** — zero telemetry measurement deployed\n4. **No `.registry.json`** — no registration or allowlist infrastructure\n5. **No `dependencies[]`** — cannot check reverse dependencies\n\n### 7 Infrastructure Gaps to Close (GAP-1 through GAP-7)\nEstimated **3 additional cycles** minimum to reach production-ready archive capability.","success":true,"task_id":"3a1eec55-7843-4b82-8d67-812b59cb5f8f"}

